    "text": "By Atlanta News First staff ,\n5 hours ago ATLANTA, Ga. (Atlanta News First) — A crash closed all northbound lanes of Georgia 400 in Forsyth County on Wednesday evening, according to the Georgia Department of Transportation (GDOT). The crash happened on Georgia 400 at Bottoms Road around 6:10 p.m. and forced all northbound lanes to close for... Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 1",
